     Keys are vg_<official Telegram Android key>; texts follow the official Telegram Android app
     (not in the TGX cloud language pack). Plural keys live in values/strings.xml (+ vg_LangLocalPlurals).
     Bold: where every bold part of the official text is an argument, the ** markers are dropped and the caller
     bolds the arguments itself with Lang.getStringBold(...). Strings that keep **literal bold** markers must go
     through Lang.getMarkdownString(context, ...) (Strings.buildMarkdown parses **; args are markdown-escaped):
